<title>FRANCE: Airbus signs order for 18 aircraft with TAP.</title>
<headline>Airbus signs order for 18 aircraft with TAP.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Airbus consortium said on Wednesday that it had signed an order for 18 A319 aircraft from TAP Air Portugal.</p>
<p>The order was originally announced on October 29.</p>
</text>
